{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"mpsc-closed-001","description":"A producer waits in tx.closed() (Rust mpsc_closed.rs:39; bd-9kll.5.7). The receiver taking the queued message does not wake it, nor does the driver's cancel (closed() takes no Cx); the receiver's drop does, after which a try_send sees ASX_E_DISCONNECTED and a checkpoint finally observes the cancel.","unit":"mpsc","rules":["inv.determinism.replayable","rule.cancel.request"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":1000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[{"name":"ch","type":"mpsc","capacity":2,"sender":"t.p","receiver":"t.r"}],"sync":[],"tasks":[{"name":"t.p","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"try_send","channel":"ch","value":1},{"op":"closed","channel":"ch"},{"op":"try_send","channel":"ch","value":2},{"op":"checkpoint"},{"op":"trace","message":"not reached"}]},{"name":"t.r","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"recv","channel":"ch"},{"op":"sleep","ns":100},{"op":"close_receiver","channel":"ch"},{"op":"trace","message":"receiver dropped"}]}],"script":[{"at_ns":50,"op":{"op":"cancel_task","task":"t.p","kind":"User"}}],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
